WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.425
So, four decisions.

2
00:00:01.425 --> 00:00:06.257
Name the owners in writing: signed
appointments, a person in every decide and

3
00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:11.013
do cell of the matrix, and the authorizing
official selecting the assessor.

4
00:00:11.013 --> 00:00:12.574
Keep one dated clock.

5
00:00:12.574 --> 00:00:15.328
Submit the post-quantum migration plan,

6
00:00:15.328 --> 00:00:19.750
and re-verify every federal date
against its source at each gate.

7
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.900
Fund the mechanisms that produce records
before the tools that measure them.

8
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.725
Assessment tools confirm a design;
they can't stand in for one.

9
00:00:27.725 --> 00:00:32.439
And generate the package: machine-readable
records, a disposition on every

10
00:00:32.439 --> 00:00:37.000
failing item, and a named reviewer
for every provider's quarterly report.

11
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.200
The next step needs no procurement.

12
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.413
Fill the product inventory questionnaire
against the estate as it is,

13
00:00:43.413 --> 00:00:46.464
verify each FedRAMP status
on the day you record it,

14
00:00:46.464 --> 00:00:49.950
and decide every flag before
the security plan is written.

15
00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.388
A promise is true on the day it's signed.

16
00:00:52.388 --> 00:00:54.113
Proof keeps showing itself.

17
00:00:54.113 --> 00:00:59.862
The Federal Modernization Workbook's Book
14 has the detail, every claim footnoted.

18
00:00:59.862 --> 00:01:00.700
Thank you.
